export anchor OutlineOnlyStyle:
    number: 202
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Outline only
    idea: Every component is drawn as a crisp 1px outline in black or blue on white paper, with no fills and no shadows, so structure comes from line alone.
    base: light
    palette:
        paper: #ffffff, the page, nothing is ever filled
        black: #111111, text, every outline and the last week bars
        gray: #585858, mono captions, axis labels and meta
        rule: #bdbdbd, row rules inside tables and chart gridlines
        blue: #1546c4, the current nav, primary button, overdue, Behind, this week hatch and focus
    type:
        Text uses Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif. Figures,
        captions and section titles use ui-monospace, SF Mono, Menlo,
        Consolas, Liberation Mono, monospace. The greeting is 36px regular
        at minus 0.02em, KPI figures 44px light, row names 15px at 600,
        body 15px, section titles 12px mono caps at 0.1em, captions 11px
        mono caps grey and table figures 13px mono.
    layout:
        A single outlined top bar is split into cells by vertical rules,
        the outlined B mark with the brand, a wide search cell, a cell with
        a blue outlined New project button, a square bell cell and the
        outlined initials circle with the name. Below, a 200px left nav is
        a ruled outlined list with icons, Home in blue with an inset blue
        outline and an arrow. The main column starts with the date in mono
        caps, a large light greeting and a blue clock with 4 tasks are
        overdue and a Show overdue link. Four KPI cells share collapsed
        1px borders in one row, the overdue cell in blue with an inset blue
        outline. A full width outlined projects table follows, with mono
        caps headings, name and team, an outlined progress track holding a
        blue hatched bar, mono tasks, due date with days left and an
        outlined status tag. The bottom row pairs a chart box, with a
        three cell totals strip and open black bars for last week beside
        blue hatched bars for this week on a ruled axis, and an activity
        box drawn as a vertical line through outlined initial circles.
        Below 960px the nav becomes a three by two ruled grid and the
        bottom row stacks. On phones the top bar becomes three rows and
        table rows turn into stacked cards.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 24px page padding and gaps, 32px between main blocks and 12 to 16px inside cells.
    density: Medium. A full width ruled table with values set in mono.
    corners: Square everywhere. Only avatars and the timeline circles are round.
    borders: 1px #111111 on every component with shared edges collapsed into one rule, 1px #bdbdbd between rows, and a blue inset second outline for the current or urgent item.
    shadows: None and no fills. Progress and this week bars use a 1px blue diagonal hatch.
    icons:
        Line icons at 1.6 to 1.8 stroke in currentColor. Status tags use a
        check circle, a triangle or a crossed square with the word, and
        Behind is doubled in blue.
    focus: A 2px blue outline offset 2px, drawn inside the cell for top bar cells and nav items.
    tone: Terse and technical, such as Due this week, 14 d left and Show overdue.
